
# <type>(<scope>)!: <subject>      (lines starting with # are ignored)
#
#   type    feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
#   scope   optional: core, cli, docs, deps
#   !       optional: marks a breaking change
#   subject imperative, present tense, lowercase start, no final period; the whole header is at most 72 characters
#
# Body (after a blank line, wrapped at 100 characters): why the change was made, not what the diff already shows.
#
# Footer (after a blank line), when needed:
#   BREAKING CHANGE: what breaks and how to migrate
#   Co-Authored-By: Your Model Name <noreply@anthropic.com>
#
# One logical change per commit. Never skip the hooks with --no-verify.
# Example: feat(envelope): add a release curve parameter
